 "headline": "White Mambas Are Hanging Forty-Five On Somebody",
 "notes": [
  "Zero Fox Given just stole 3PT% from Nova Knicks, which is the only reason DeMar DeRozan's 1-for-5 night isn't a total funeral.",
  "Jamal Murray dropped 45 points and six threes for White Mambas, and LeParth James is somehow still in the building trying to compete.",
  "White Mambas have eight players with a stat line and the best night in the league. Bam Adebayo, Josh Giddey and Murray did the work.",
  "Suggs to be you ranks last tonight. Darryn Peterson shot 3-for-9 for six points, and Andrew Nembhard went 5-for-13 to ruin his own FG%.",
  "Kevin Huerter shot 1-for-8 for two points for theInfamous, and Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw dropped him for a guy shooting 6-for-7."
 ],
